OL,3,AMalaysia begins controversial
OL,4,Arepatriation of asylum seekers to
OL,5,AMyanmar
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Malaysian government has started
OL,8,Frepatriating around 5,000 asylum
OL,9,Fseekers from Myanmar, under a
OL,10,Fcontroversial deal agreed with
OL,11,FMyanmar's military ruler Min Aung
OL,12,FHlaing.
OL,14,FThree ships from the Myanmar navy are
OL,15,Fscheduled to leave Malaysia later today
OL,16,Fcarrying the first 1,476 returnees.
OL,18,FHuman rights groups have condemned the
OL,19,Frepatriation, saying the returnees face
OL,20,Fviolence, persecution and forced
OL,21,Fconscription into the Myanmar army.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
